title: SPIR-V Specification
author: John Kessenich, Google
author: Boaz Ouriel, Intel
author: Raun Krisch, Intel
changes:

=== Changes from Version 1.3

- New Functionality:
* Public issue #35: <<OpEntryPoint, *OpEntryPoint*>> must list all global variables in the interface. Additionally, duplication in the list is not allowed.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #140: Generalize <<OpSelect, *OpSelect*>> to select between two objects.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #156: Add *OpUConvert* to the list of required opcodes in <<OpSpecConstantOp, *OpSpecConstantOp*>>.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #345: Generalize the *NonWritable* <<Decoration, decoration>> to include *Private* and *Function* storage classes.
  This helps identify lookup tables.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #84: Add <<OpCopyLogical, **OpCopyLogical**>> to copy similar but unequal types.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #170: Add <<OpPtrEqual, **OpPtrEqual**>> and <<OpPtrNotEqual, **OpPtrNotEqual**>> to compare pointers.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #362: Add <<OpPtrDiff, *OpPtrDiff*>> to count the number of elements between two element pointers.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #332: Add *SignExtend* and *ZeroExtend* <<Image_Operands, image operands>>.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #340: Add the *UniformId* <<Decoration, decoration>>, which takes a _Scope_ operand.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #112: Add iteration-control <<Loop_Control, loop controls>>.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #366: Change _Memory Access_ operands and the *Memory Access* section to now be _Memory Operands_ and
  the <<Memory_Operands, *Memory Operands*>> section.
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #357: Allow <<OpCopyMemory, *OpCopyMemory*>> and <<OpCopyMemorySized, *OpCopyMemorySized*>> to have
  <<Memory_Operands, _Memory Operands_>> for both their _Source_ and _Target_.

- New Extensions Incorporated into SPIR-V 1.4:
* SPV_KHR_no_integer_wrap_decoration. See *NoSignedWrap* and *NoUnsignedWrap* <<Decoration, decorations>> and <<Validation, universal validation>>
  decoration rules.
* SPV_GOOGLE_decorate_string. See <<OpDecorateString, *OpDecorateString*>> and <<OpMemberDecorateString, *OpMemberDecorateString*>>.
* SPV_GOOGLE_hlsl_functionality1. See *CounterBuffer* and *UserSemantic* <<Decoration, decorations>>.
* SPV_KHR_float_controls. See *DenormPreserve*, *DenormFlushToZero*, *SignedZeroInfNanPreserve*, *RoundingModeRTE*, and *RoundingModeRTZ*
  <<Execution_Mode, execution modes>> and <<Capability, capabilities>>.

- Removed:
* Khronos SPIR-V Issue #437: Removed <<OpAtomicCompareExchangeWeak, *OpAtomicCompareExchangeWeak*>>, and
  the **BufferBlock** <<Decoration, decoration>>.
